</p>

</div>

</header>


<main class="shell">

<div id="profileBar" class="profile-bar hidden"></div>


<!-- TOP NAVIGATION CARDS -->

<div class="nav-grid">

<button class="nav-card" id="definitionsCard">

<div class="nav-icon">📚</div>

<h2>Definitions</h2>

<p>
Learn what grammar means and understand the language basics.
</p>

</button>


<button class="nav-card" id="questionsCard">

<div class="nav-icon">❓</div>

<h2>Questions</h2>

<p>
Understand what questions are and why they are useful.
</p>

</button>

</div>


<!-- DEFINITIONS INFORMATION -->

<section class="section hidden" id="definitionsSection">

<div class="section-head">

<h2>📚 Grammar Definitions</h2>

<p>
Simple explanations for parents and beginners.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="definition-grid" id="definitionsArea"></div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- WHAT ARE QUESTIONS INFORMATION -->

<section class="section hidden" id="whatQuestionsSection">

<div class="section-head">

<h2>❓ What are Questions?</h2>

<p>
The purpose of questions, explained simply.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<div class="info-list">

<div class="info-step">

<b>1</b>

<p>
Questions help you check how well you understand grammar.
</p>

</div>


<div class="info-step">

<b>2</b>

<p>
You choose the answer you think is correct.
</p>

</div>


<div class="info-step">

<b>3</b>

<p>
Your answer is checked so you can know whether you are correct.
</p>

</div>


<div class="info-step">

<b>4</b>

<p>
The explanation helps you understand why the correct answer is right.
</p>

</div>

</div>


<div class="info-note">

Questions are useful because they help you practise grammar,
identify mistakes and improve your understanding.

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- NORMAL QUESTIONS / ACTIVITIES -->

<section class="section" id="activitySection">

<div class="section-head">

<h2>Questions</h2>

<p>
Choose an activity.
</p>

</div>


<div class="nav-grid" style="max-width:820px">

<button class="nav-card" id="startQuestions">

<div class="nav-icon">❓</div>

<h2>Grammar Questions</h2>

<p>
Answer multiple-choice questions and learn from explanations.
</p>

</button>


<button class="nav-card" id="startPuzzles">

<div class="nav-icon">🧩</div>

<h2>Puzzles</h2>

<p>
Solve language-based challenges.
</p>

